1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
I'd have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know...

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As Imake foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
I'm bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback the time to awaken is now

20
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,086
What is this picture?!

21
00:01:36,086 --> 00:01:37,521
Of all the ridiculous...!

22
00:01:37,521 --> 00:01:39,869
I thought we told him
to remove the damned "D.", too!

23
00:01:39,869 --> 00:01:41,869
No, sir, we weren't told about it!

24
00:01:42,913 --> 00:01:45,652
We received the photos
from Guernica-sama of CP-0.

25
00:01:45,652 --> 00:01:47,696
You will reprint them,
immediately!

26
00:01:47,696 --> 00:01:50,130
Hear me? Such drivel will not be
unleashed unto the world!

27
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:53,130
But sir, we're unable to
contact the printing company...

28
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:57,260
Useless, the whole lot of them!

29
00:01:58,347 --> 00:02:00,782
We must stop distribution, somehow!

30
00:02:05,217 --> 00:02:08,000
What's this?
This mystical figure...!

31
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,913
Deliver! Deliver!

32
00:02:09,913 --> 00:02:12,217
Deliver every single copy,
employees of mine!

33
00:02:12,217 --> 00:02:17,347
Cipher Pol infiltrated Wano,
and no one's heard from them since!

34
00:02:17,782 --> 00:02:21,826
Their final transmission:
It's Big Mom's ship!"

35
00:02:21,826 --> 00:02:25,869
I'm not letting 'em cover this up!

36
00:02:25,869 --> 00:02:29,956
The times are a-changin',
and that's when the truth's the most interesting!

37
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,957
There's nothing like good old
live entertainment!

38
00:02:39,782 --> 00:02:41,217
W-What the?!

39
00:02:41,696 --> 00:02:43,174
It's a special edition!

40
00:02:43,174 --> 00:02:44,043
An incident?!

41
00:02:44,043 --> 00:02:46,216
Hey, check this out!

42
00:02:46,217 --> 00:02:50,260
"Emperors of the Sea,
Kaido and Big Mom, Defeated!"

43
00:02:50,608 --> 00:02:55,608
In seemingly no time at all,
the massive headline circled the globe.

44
00:02:56,086 --> 00:03:00,390
As for the trio of pirate captains
who felled the two Emperors...

45
00:03:00,391 --> 00:03:02,261
...that lorded over the seas for decades...

46
00:03:02,696 --> 00:03:08,565
The Government placed an exorbitant bounty
of three billion berries on each of them!

47
00:03:11,652 --> 00:03:13,913
Three billion berries?!

48
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,957
Boss!

49
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,782
Wow, Captain!

50
00:03:16,782 --> 00:03:19,478
Hey!
Lemme get a closer look!

51
00:03:19,478 --> 00:03:21,217
Read here.

52
00:03:22,043 --> 00:03:23,216
No freakin' way!

53
00:03:23,217 --> 00:03:24,782
Unbelievable!

54
00:03:25,565 --> 00:03:27,347
Whoa, Boss!!

55
00:03:27,347 --> 00:03:31,347
Where's Kid off to now?
And with that weird look on his face...

56
00:03:31,347 --> 00:03:33,304
Probably to the Flower Capital.

57
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:39,390
We got a new Emperor of the Sea, huh?

58
00:03:39,391 --> 00:03:42,086
No wonder they picked them....

59
00:03:42,086 --> 00:03:45,738
Hey, guys! Heard they're havin'
a feast in the capital today.

60
00:03:45,739 --> 00:03:47,347
Let's join 'em!

61
00:03:47,347 --> 00:03:48,738
Aye!

62
00:03:48,739 --> 00:03:50,913
Just in time!
We gotta celebrate!

63
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,130
Let's get crazy!

64
00:03:53,217 --> 00:03:56,304
Yay! Festival, festival!

65
00:03:56,347 --> 00:03:58,825
We're pumped!

66
00:04:01,913 --> 00:04:04,913
And there goes trouble, again...

67
00:04:04,913 --> 00:04:07,521
Add cloud ear mushrooms
and chrysanthemum petals to the soup.

68
00:04:07,521 --> 00:04:12,086
A plate of gisei tofu.
Abowl of flower-shaped lotus roots.

69
00:04:12,086 --> 00:04:13,869
Asmall bowl of pickled vegetables...

70
00:04:14,304 --> 00:04:17,390
We must not let anything happen
to our valued guests.

71
00:04:17,391 --> 00:04:21,174
So we grind everything once,
heat it up, and reshape it,

72
00:04:21,217 --> 00:04:22,782
then test it for poison three times...

73
00:04:23,435 --> 00:04:27,478
And now, my skills
are on full display today!

74
00:04:27,478 --> 00:04:32,913
Please partake of our traditional cuisine,
worthy of the Shogun himself!

75
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,609
Ah, what is this?
B-But why?!

76
00:04:37,608 --> 00:04:41,608
None of them could wait the two hours
for the dishes to be ready.

77
00:04:41,608 --> 00:04:46,565
Still, it all looks so delicious!
I appreciate your consideration!

78
00:04:48,347 --> 00:04:51,043
It's quite lively out there,
wouldn't you say!

79
00:04:51,043 --> 00:04:53,043
Festival, festival!

80
00:04:53,043 --> 00:04:55,043
Let's play 'til we drop!

81
00:04:55,086 --> 00:04:56,303
Yeah!

82
00:04:56,347 --> 00:04:59,217
There's chocolate bananas
and yakisoba!

83
00:04:59,217 --> 00:05:01,782
Takoyaki and grilled squid!

84
00:05:01,782 --> 00:05:03,086
Cotton candy, too!

85
00:05:08,086 --> 00:05:09,999
This's the best!

86
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,957
Everything's on the house today!

87
00:05:11,957 --> 00:05:12,957
On the house!

88
00:05:14,174 --> 00:05:17,130
This is my first time at a festival!
Such fun!

89
00:05:17,130 --> 00:05:21,478
There's so much tasty stuff,
I can't decide what I wanna eat next!

90
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,608
Say, you two!
What are those?

91
00:05:24,608 --> 00:05:26,391
They're called candy apples!

92
00:05:26,391 --> 00:05:28,130
'Tis practically a jewel!

93
00:05:28,913 --> 00:05:30,261
Beautiful!

94
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:38,565
Sweet and sour!
Wonderful flavors!

95
00:05:38,565 --> 00:05:41,651
Any other fruit
wouldn't taste this good!

96
00:05:41,652 --> 00:05:44,087
What're we waitin' for?!
Let's dig in!

97
00:05:48,826 --> 00:05:50,565
Sho good!

98
00:05:52,391 --> 00:05:54,913
Say, since you two know so much,

99
00:05:54,913 --> 00:05:57,739
tell me of any
non-food stalls as well!

100
00:05:57,739 --> 00:05:59,565
Awwright, leave it t'me!

101
00:05:59,608 --> 00:06:03,304
When you're full
you just gotta go...

102
00:06:04,608 --> 00:06:08,391
Gum-Gum Target Shooting!

103
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:11,390
Oh yeah!
Got 'im good!

104
00:06:12,391 --> 00:06:14,260
You are a funny one, Luffy!

105
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:16,347
Luffy, you're not supposed
to use your hands!

106
00:06:16,347 --> 00:06:18,217
Can I go again, old guy?

107
00:06:18,217 --> 00:06:19,608
Nuhhh?!

108
00:06:23,043 --> 00:06:24,651
It broke...

109
00:06:24,652 --> 00:06:25,869
How about another try?

110
00:06:25,869 --> 00:06:28,173
Okay, it's my turn!

111
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,304
They're in!

112
00:06:37,304 --> 00:06:39,043
Oh, that was amazing!

113
00:06:39,043 --> 00:06:41,129
You're pretty good, Chopper!

114
00:06:42,782 --> 00:06:46,695
You ain't gonna make me happy
by complimenting me, ya jerks!

115
00:06:46,696 --> 00:06:48,609
But he looks really happy...

116
00:06:50,043 --> 00:06:53,477
Yeah!
You all having a great time, folks?

117
00:06:53,478 --> 00:06:55,869
Yeah!

118
00:06:56,347 --> 00:06:59,564
Yeah, all right!
Rock on, Brook!

119
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:04,174
This number is a big hit,
and it's going to light up Wano!

120
00:07:04,174 --> 00:07:08,782
I'm gonna deliver to you the finest soul music,
together with the princess you all love!

121
00:07:09,130 --> 00:07:12,913
That's right! It's the song
that Brother Oden loved!

122
00:07:13,869 --> 00:07:15,043
"Moon Princess"!

123
00:07:17,478 --> 00:07:19,043
Princess Hiyori!

124
00:07:34,739 --> 00:07:35,826
What might these be?

125
00:07:35,826 --> 00:07:38,869
Piqued your interest, Nico Robin?

126
00:07:38,869 --> 00:07:41,434
Tengu-san!
How do you know my name?

127
00:07:41,435 --> 00:07:43,217
My personal collection.

128
00:07:43,217 --> 00:07:43,739
What?

129
00:07:43,739 --> 00:07:46,782
Comely, are they not?
My beautiful girl kokeshi dolls!

130
00:07:46,782 --> 00:07:47,695
Not particularly.

131
00:07:47,696 --> 00:07:49,217
Oof!

132
00:07:49,565 --> 00:07:52,434
My, how melodramatic!
You're so silly, Tengu-san.

133
00:07:53,391 --> 00:07:57,043
Now that I think about it,
why keep your collection here?

134
00:07:57,043 --> 00:08:02,651
This is my secret hobby room,
and the place in which I was confined for many years.

135
00:08:02,652 --> 00:08:03,913
"Confined"?

136
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:09,086
I suppose you're more than
just a swordsmith, then.

137
00:08:09,086 --> 00:08:11,260
Smithing is but
a mere hobby of mine.

138
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:13,738
Though it seems I've the aptitude for it.

139
00:08:19,478 --> 00:08:21,782
Governing tires me so...

140
00:08:22,347 --> 00:08:24,564
Who are you, really?

141
00:08:24,608 --> 00:08:25,869
I?

142
00:08:31,739 --> 00:08:34,696
Kozuki Sukiyakı
My name is Kozuki Sukiyaki.

143
00:08:37,565 --> 00:08:39,260
What a surprise!

144
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:40,738
Does Momo-chan know?

145
00:08:40,739 --> 00:08:43,304
He does not.
Nor do I intend to tell him.

146
00:08:43,304 --> 00:08:44,304
But...

147
00:08:44,869 --> 00:08:48,782
...our retainers may have noticed.

148
00:08:48,782 --> 00:08:54,043
I am the principal culprit in allowing
Orochi to usurp our country's throne.

149
00:08:55,217 --> 00:08:57,956
As such, who would I be able
to tell that I yet live?

150
00:08:58,478 --> 00:09:01,869
When I barely escaped
this room with my life,

151
00:09:01,869 --> 00:09:06,782
Oden was already dead,
and the Land of Wano had changed for the worse.

152
00:09:06,782 --> 00:09:10,521
I considered
ritual disembowelment where I stood,

153
00:09:11,957 --> 00:09:13,783
but had no choice but to hide...

154
00:09:14,174 --> 00:09:17,739
...until the coming day
for the sake of my remaining mission.

155
00:09:22,130 --> 00:09:24,478
And now, after what transpired since,

156
00:09:24,478 --> 00:09:28,608
I owe my deepest gratitude
to all of you for everything.

157
00:09:29,521 --> 00:09:33,217
I'm sure they'll all be happy to hear that.

158
00:09:34,217 --> 00:09:35,565
Is that so...

159
00:09:36,304 --> 00:09:39,347
Ah, Tengu-san.
There's something I'd like to talk to you about..

160
00:09:39,957 --> 00:09:43,130
I believe this country possesses one of them...
The Ancient Weapon,

161
00:09:43,130 --> 00:09:44,174
Pluton.

162
00:09:50,304 --> 00:09:51,608
How do you know this?!

163
00:09:52,652 --> 00:09:56,435
It's written on the Poneglyph
in the Kingdom of Alabasta.

164
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:01,347
And here I did not expect
anyone to know so much...

165
00:10:03,130 --> 00:10:04,217
Aye, 'tis here.

166
00:10:17,304 --> 00:10:20,999
Noooo, I'm the
don't-wanna-be-thin kind of guy...!

167
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,043
I warned ya not to test me, didn't I?!

168
00:10:23,043 --> 00:10:27,303
A guy in my position can't go around
getting beat by some pirate's underlings!

169
00:10:27,696 --> 00:10:31,782
The Navy don't got the manpower
to clean up this mess right now.

170
00:10:31,782 --> 00:10:34,086
Still, turned out
like I thought it would...

171
00:10:34,086 --> 00:10:36,738
Well, I guess you guys did okay...

172
00:10:45,782 --> 00:10:48,130
Ain't the best swill, for sure...

173
00:10:48,130 --> 00:10:51,000
Sheesh...
Shoulda aged it longer.

174
00:10:52,217 --> 00:10:54,652
Ring, ring, ring...
Clik.

175
00:10:54,696 --> 00:10:55,826
Yes, sir, this is

176
00:10:55,826 --> 00:10:59,391
Hey, it's me.
Send a battleship to Wano, on the double!

177
00:10:59,391 --> 00:11:01,391
What?! Oh, G-Green Bull-

178
00:11:01,391 --> 00:11:04,260
And no tattlin'
to Sakazuki-san! Out.

179
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:05,130
Clik.

180
00:11:07,478 --> 00:11:09,608
I like that about him, really do.

181
00:11:10,652 --> 00:11:13,261
His "cut no corners" attitude.

182
00:11:16,826 --> 00:11:20,391
I wanna earn his praise,
like a "Good job" or something...

183
00:11:20,391 --> 00:11:22,565
By taking this brat's head, maybe...

184
00:11:28,913 --> 00:11:30,000
Who's that up there?

185
00:11:32,086 --> 00:11:34,216
Kay, listen up, everybody!

186
00:11:35,304 --> 00:11:37,608
Ninjas, pirates, Minks, and samurai!

187
00:11:37,608 --> 00:11:38,912
The king's retainers!

188
00:11:38,913 --> 00:11:41,608
Yakuza, and all of Wano!

189
00:11:41,608 --> 00:11:45,173
Way to put up a hell of a fight,
ye scalawags!

190
00:11:45,174 --> 00:11:46,434
Good going, young man!

191
00:11:46,435 --> 00:11:48,086
Make a toast!

192
00:11:48,086 --> 00:11:49,999
Do it, feastmaster!

193
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,957
Awwright, you got it!

194
00:11:53,347 --> 00:11:54,912
Luffy...

195
00:11:56,174 --> 00:11:59,130
Don't tell the
whole country about me.

196
00:11:59,130 --> 00:12:00,434
Why would I not?

197
00:12:00,435 --> 00:12:02,435
It'd make me a hero.

198
00:12:02,435 --> 00:12:07,043
And what is the matter with that?
There is no denying your victory over Kaido!

199
00:12:07,043 --> 00:12:08,347
Ya big idiot!

200
00:12:08,347 --> 00:12:10,999
Everyone's been waitin'
for you, Momo!

201
00:12:13,130 --> 00:12:14,521
Get out of my way!

202
00:12:14,565 --> 00:12:16,391
Straw Hat!

203
00:12:17,086 --> 00:12:19,129
If I get rid of you here...

204
00:12:19,217 --> 00:12:20,174
Jaggy!

205
00:12:20,174 --> 00:12:22,869
Let's set them off!

206
00:12:23,696 --> 00:12:26,652
All right! To tomorrow's food...

207
00:12:29,435 --> 00:12:31,087
The hell're ya doin'?!

208
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,391
Here we go!

209
00:12:35,478 --> 00:12:37,869
Cheers!

210
00:12:42,608 --> 00:12:44,391
Make some noise!

211
00:12:44,435 --> 00:12:45,739
Yeah!

212
00:12:52,696 --> 00:12:55,086
I'll absolutely keep drinking to that!

213
00:12:55,086 --> 00:12:56,956
party!

214
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:01,522
Let's Got that, y'all!
We're gonna drink the night away!

215
00:13:02,347 --> 00:13:05,825
They're a wild bunch,
those pirates...

216
00:13:05,826 --> 00:13:10,782
Honestly, who's ever heard of such
an enormous feast as this?

217
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:23,521
Hey, don't get me involved!

218
00:13:23,521 --> 00:13:25,825
Oh, come on! It's a party!

219
00:13:25,826 --> 00:13:28,434
ain't got a clue about
what's happening overseas...

220
00:13:28,478 --> 00:13:31,826
But d'ya see this crap?!
This's why I'm here to get rid of ya!

221
00:13:38,347 --> 00:13:41,260
Hwuuuuh?!

222
00:13:41,957 --> 00:13:45,826
Indeed, Eustass Kid went to Luffy,
an expression of anger on his face,

223
00:13:45,826 --> 00:13:48,434
for a very clear reason.

224
00:13:48,435 --> 00:13:51,739
It is the herald of
the end of the old regime,

225
00:13:51,739 --> 00:13:55,000
and the beginning of a new era.

226
00:13:56,869 --> 00:13:59,043
Buggy, the Genius Jester...

227
00:14:00,435 --> 00:14:02,217
"Blackbeard" Teach...

228
00:14:03,696 --> 00:14:05,261
Red-Haired Shanks...

229
00:14:08,347 --> 00:14:11,608
And Straw Hat Luffy...

230
00:14:12,608 --> 00:14:16,347
These are the new emperors...
The Four Emperors of the Sea!

231
00:14:27,913 --> 00:14:30,652
The festival music
sounds awfully happy...

232
00:14:31,174 --> 00:14:35,174
But the Navy ain't
in the mood for that, brats...

233
00:14:36,478 --> 00:14:38,826
Partytime's over...

234
00:14:40,957 --> 00:14:43,565
I'm gonna bleed all of you dry...

235
00:14:50,347 --> 00:14:53,782
The outside world's a mess...

236
00:14:53,826 --> 00:14:57,086
I'm gonna take your head,
so just wait for me there...

237
00:15:30,217 --> 00:15:32,434
Been a while...

238
00:15:35,608 --> 00:15:39,999
This is my first time back here
since we said goodbye to Oden-san...

239
00:15:43,043 --> 00:15:46,912
Momo and Hiyori must be
all grown up by now...

240
00:15:56,565 --> 00:15:58,521
There's something here...

241
00:16:00,782 --> 00:16:03,086
...that shouldn't be here.

242
00:16:11,086 --> 00:16:12,043
Ms. Ninja Lady?

243
00:16:27,086 --> 00:16:28,564
Something foul approaches.

244
00:16:28,565 --> 00:16:29,912
It comes from outside.

245
00:16:29,913 --> 00:16:31,696
Shinobu!

246
00:16:32,347 --> 00:16:33,564
You both felt it as well?

247
00:16:33,565 --> 00:16:36,130
Something approaches!

248
00:16:36,130 --> 00:16:37,695
Take heed, all...

249
00:16:38,478 --> 00:16:42,478
Luffy-dono and his comrades
are still recovering from their battle wounds.

250
00:16:42,782 --> 00:16:44,826
Do not let them know about this!

251
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:52,434
So you-gara noticed, too?

252
00:16:52,913 --> 00:16:55,217
We must not allow
the din of the festival to stop!

253
00:16:55,739 --> 00:16:56,739
Onward!

254
00:17:08,130 --> 00:17:10,434
They say "influence" is something...

255
00:17:11,957 --> 00:17:13,870
...that's hard to come by...

256
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,348
...When you really want it.

257
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,086
Hey, now.

258
00:17:28,086 --> 00:17:31,347
Only guy I've got business with
is Straw Hat Luffy.

259
00:17:34,565 --> 00:17:37,217
Don't get in my way, samurai.

260
00:17:37,696 --> 00:17:41,043
H-He is... a marine of the Navy!

261
00:17:41,043 --> 00:17:43,956
The enemy Luffy-dono
and his crew faced abroad!

262
00:17:45,478 --> 00:17:48,739
You bunch actually know
about the outside world, huh?

263
00:17:50,217 --> 00:17:53,174
Then... d'ya know about this?

264
00:17:55,826 --> 00:17:57,565
Flower Shuriken!

265
00:18:07,043 --> 00:18:08,303
Shinobu!

266
00:18:08,304 --> 00:18:08,999
Raizo!

267
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,739
Aye!

268
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,609
Kappa Style:

269
00:18:20,435 --> 00:18:22,652
River of Retribution!

270
00:18:26,174 --> 00:18:27,391
Sheesh...

271
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:36,956
What?!

272
00:18:36,957 --> 00:18:38,435
Determined, aren't ya...

273
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:40,390
...ya damn samurai!

274
00:18:46,174 --> 00:18:47,347
Raizo-sama!

275
00:18:50,174 --> 00:18:53,086
The Celestial Dragons
are the gods of the world!

276
00:18:53,086 --> 00:18:57,216
And since this country isn't
a member of the World Government,

277
00:18:57,217 --> 00:19:00,956
you ain't got no rights!

278
00:19:02,739 --> 00:19:03,565
I am sorry...!

279
00:19:05,043 --> 00:19:08,173
Groves of Wrath!

280
00:19:31,521 --> 00:19:35,130
I ate the Woods-Woods Fruit
and became a Woodsman!

281
00:19:40,086 --> 00:19:43,303
Just like the seas,
the woods bear forth life!

282
00:19:44,174 --> 00:19:46,956
It's the very essence of Logia!

283
00:19:46,957 --> 00:19:51,043
If you're gonna be in my way,
I'll just deal with the bunch of ya permanently!

284
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:56,957
It don't matter how many people I kill in this country
'cause the law don't reach here!

285
00:19:59,043 --> 00:20:03,129
You spurn us?!
How can you think so little of our people?!

286
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:07,826
Here's a lesson for ya:
Humanity's always kept some of its own down!

287
00:20:08,435 --> 00:20:14,087
That's 'cause the sacrifice of a few's
necessary to make peace for the many!

288
00:20:15,739 --> 00:20:20,478
Non-member countries like yours
are sacrificed for the sake of the world!

289
00:20:20,478 --> 00:20:25,174
And by keepin' folks like you down,
the rest of us can go on with our lives!

290
00:20:25,174 --> 00:20:27,869
Discrimination is comfort!

291
00:20:32,043 --> 00:20:34,869
Don't hate me, though!
That's just the way the world works!

292
00:20:43,086 --> 00:20:44,347
Stop me if ya can!

293
00:20:51,435 --> 00:20:54,521
Even if it means
killin' thousands of people,

294
00:20:54,608 --> 00:20:58,478
I'm gonna get my hands
on Straw Hat Luffy!

295
00:20:58,478 --> 00:21:01,130
Every last word of yours...

296
00:21:01,130 --> 00:21:03,521
inexcusable!

297
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:26,000
'Ey, boss!
Let's go see Luffy!

298
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,869
He's pretty much
a great pirate now!

299
00:21:28,869 --> 00:21:31,782
Whattaguy, eh?

300
00:21:31,782 --> 00:21:33,999
Whattaguy, for real!

301
00:21:42,565 --> 00:21:45,260
Yow, ow, owch!

302
00:21:45,260 --> 00:21:47,130
That's some strong Haki!

303
00:21:47,130 --> 00:21:49,521
For twenty years,
they endured tyranny...

304
00:21:49,521 --> 00:21:55,521
And only now were they fully liberated,
so I will not allow any interruption of their celebration!

305
00:21:55,521 --> 00:21:57,217
Who the hell're you?!

306
00:21:57,217 --> 00:22:00,391
I am Yamato, son of Kaido!

307
00:22:01,696 --> 00:22:03,086
Kaido's...?

308
00:22:03,086 --> 00:22:05,260
Right you are, Yamato!

309
00:22:06,260 --> 00:22:07,347
Momonosuke-sama!

310
00:22:09,347 --> 00:22:13,912
You will not lay your hand
upon our recovering heroes!

311
00:22:13,913 --> 00:22:15,478
A dragon?!

312
00:22:18,217 --> 00:22:20,260
Blast Breath!

313
00:22:30,608 --> 00:22:32,043
Momonosuke-sama!

314
00:22:32,043 --> 00:22:33,999
Regardless...!

315
00:22:36,086 --> 00:22:39,173
Begone!
Leave the sight of the capital!

316
00:22:39,217 --> 00:22:41,217
Do not cause my people anguish!

317
00:22:41,217 --> 00:22:44,217
I promised my people
there would be no more!

318
00:22:44,521 --> 00:22:47,043
Strange...
A pink dragon?

319
00:22:47,043 --> 00:22:49,695
I've never heard of
such a Devil Fruit power!

320
00:22:49,696 --> 00:22:50,782
You're in my way!

321
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:01,348
Momonosuke-kun!

322
00:23:02,826 --> 00:23:04,260
Yamato!

323
00:23:05,130 --> 00:23:07,652
You must not fight!

324
00:23:07,652 --> 00:23:08,435
Eh?

325
00:23:19,391 --> 00:23:22,304
We're gonna be inside
Wano's borders soon!

326
00:23:22,304 --> 00:23:23,782
H-Hey!

327
00:23:24,957 --> 00:23:26,609
Hold off on going ashore...

328
00:23:27,347 --> 00:23:29,434
I'm...

329
00:23:29,435 --> 00:23:32,652
...not really ready to see Usopp...

330
00:23:32,652 --> 00:23:36,086
Yeah... And I bet that
brat Kid's still there, too!

331
00:23:36,086 --> 00:23:39,434
He came tryin' to pick a fight
with us just the other day!

332
00:23:39,435 --> 00:23:41,304
Ah, pipe down!

333
00:23:41,304 --> 00:23:44,695
The Boss'll decide what we're doin'.

334
00:23:51,086 --> 00:23:52,303
This is...

335
00:24:09,260 --> 00:24:10,130
That's...

336
00:24:10,130 --> 00:24:11,521
Red-Haired's ship!

337
00:24:13,435 --> 00:24:17,087
Pain in my ass...

338
00:24:19,826 --> 00:24:22,173
We're going!

339
00:24:25,696 --> 00:24:28,478
Fire! Keep Red-Haired away!

340
00:24:36,652 --> 00:24:38,956
What's he doing?!

341
00:24:39,391 --> 00:24:40,435
What does he want?!

342
00:24:40,957 --> 00:24:43,130
There's no treasure on this ship!

343
00:24:43,608 --> 00:24:45,782
There's just one Devil Fruit...

344
00:24:46,130 --> 00:24:49,000
All it does is turn you into rubber!

345
00:25:05,957 --> 00:25:09,739
I'mma prove it to ya!

346
00:25:12,739 --> 00:25:14,565
Uh-huh, go on then!

347
00:25:18,696 --> 00:25:21,652
Owwieee!

348
00:25:21,652 --> 00:25:22,565
You dunce!

349
00:25:22,565 --> 00:25:24,260
What the hellre you doing?!

350
00:25:24,782 --> 00:25:26,782
Hey, wait, Luffy.

351
00:25:31,391 --> 00:25:33,130
His arm stretched!

352
00:25:33,217 --> 00:25:36,565
The heck's going on?!

353
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,609
Scram.

354
00:26:01,043 --> 00:26:04,564
I thought you were a man!

355
00:26:05,478 --> 00:26:07,652
But... Shanks...!

356
00:26:08,739 --> 00:26:11,348
Your arm!

357
00:26:17,347 --> 00:26:20,912
Guess all our bosses know
Straw Hat Luffy personally...

358
00:26:20,913 --> 00:26:23,435
They say Straw Hat Luffy's...

359
00:26:23,435 --> 00:26:29,217
I heard he's outta control,
a totally savage monster of an ape...!

360
00:26:29,739 --> 00:26:31,347
Got no intention of seeing Luffy.

361
00:26:31,347 --> 00:26:33,043
What?!

362
00:26:33,043 --> 00:26:36,651
Think about what's going on
in our territories these days.

363
00:26:36,652 --> 00:26:39,652
That man going on about
being Luffy's henchman, Barto...

364
00:26:39,652 --> 00:26:41,130
Barto... whatshisface?

365
00:26:41,130 --> 00:26:44,478
He burned our Jolly Roger
and changed it to Luffy's...

366
00:26:44,478 --> 00:26:47,086
He's the future Pirate King,
Luffy-senpai!

367
00:26:47,086 --> 00:26:49,651
This is his crew's sticker!

368
00:26:49,652 --> 00:26:52,869
This island's the territory of
Shanks of the Four Emperors!

369
00:26:52,869 --> 00:26:53,912
Say whuh?

370
00:26:58,521 --> 00:27:01,738
One o' the Four Emperors?!
I dun give a crap!

371
00:27:01,869 --> 00:27:05,782
If we just let it slide...
I'd lose people's trust in me.

372
00:27:05,782 --> 00:27:08,695
Well, that's true...
But still...!

373
00:27:08,696 --> 00:27:11,782
Aw, c'mon, Boss!
I wanna see him!

374
00:27:13,696 --> 00:27:15,304
I wanna see him!

375
00:27:15,304 --> 00:27:16,912
Me, too!

376
00:27:17,608 --> 00:27:21,869
We can't allow the Revolutionary Army
to run around unchecked, Red Hound!

377
00:27:22,478 --> 00:27:26,435
I know that already,
but I don't got the troops to deploy.

378
00:27:27,217 --> 00:27:28,260
Sabo...

379
00:27:28,260 --> 00:27:31,999
He's a hero to the world now!

380
00:27:32,869 --> 00:27:37,608
Eight hundred years ago,
the World Government was created by twenty founders.

381
00:27:37,608 --> 00:27:43,651
Of their descendants, only Nefertari Cobra
attended the Reverie this year.

382
00:27:43,652 --> 00:27:47,087
That's why his murder had
significance to the Revolutionary Army!

383
00:27:48,521 --> 00:27:53,999
A few hours before that, in the Land of the Gods
where the Celestial Dragons live,

384
00:27:54,000 --> 00:28:00,217
they destroyed the Hoof of the Celestial Dragon,
the symbol of the World Nobles, and declared war!

385
00:28:00,217 --> 00:28:05,521
Led by Admirals Green Bull and Wisteria Tiger,
the Navy fought back, but the outcome...

386
00:28:05,521 --> 00:28:09,478
Former Revolutionary Army soldier and
Celestial Dragon slave...

387
00:28:09,478 --> 00:28:13,826
...Bartholomew Kuma was freed,
and they all escaped!

388
00:28:16,347 --> 00:28:21,695
It must've been difficult for the Admirals
to fight in the Land of the Gods.

389
00:28:21,696 --> 00:28:24,782
You don't need to
make excuses for them.

390
00:28:25,478 --> 00:28:32,478
And what of Princess Vivi's disappearance?
This occurred around the same time as Cobra's murder...

391
00:28:32,478 --> 00:28:36,435
Both cases currently under investigation,
along with any connection between them.

392
00:28:36,869 --> 00:28:39,478
Alabasta's got to be
a complete mess.

393
00:28:39,478 --> 00:28:43,652
King Cobra's ship
is still at the Red Port...

394
00:28:43,652 --> 00:28:46,130
The situation dictates
they can't leave for home.

395
00:28:47,391 --> 00:28:51,782
Can we close the case
on the attempted murder of Saint Charlos?

396
00:28:51,782 --> 00:28:55,912
In regard to Saint Myosgard
excusing the assailants,

397
00:28:55,913 --> 00:28:58,608
they're still deliberating
in the Land of the Gods.

398
00:28:58,608 --> 00:29:02,956
The Holy Knights intervened,
and it's getting complicated.

399
00:29:05,478 --> 00:29:07,565
Leave them to it!

400
00:29:07,913 --> 00:29:14,260
People are excited, thinking that
Sabo was behind all these incidents!

401
00:29:14,260 --> 00:29:19,695
The lands that were a part of the recent
Eight-Nation Revolution,

402
00:29:20,260 --> 00:29:23,608
and anywhere around the world
where there's sparks of rebellion,

403
00:29:23,608 --> 00:29:28,782
have started worshipping him like a god!

404
00:29:29,391 --> 00:29:33,174
They're calling him
the "Flame Emperor"!

405
00:29:33,652 --> 00:29:35,304
His popularity now exceeds...

406
00:29:35,304 --> 00:29:41,695
...that of "Insurgent Serpent" Dragon,
leader of the Revolutionary Army!

407
00:29:42,478 --> 00:29:48,826
And to top it all off, his younger brother,
Straw Hat Luffy, is now one of the Four Emperors.

408
00:29:50,782 --> 00:29:52,565
In the pirate world,

409
00:29:52,565 --> 00:29:56,043
the Flame Emperor's brother
did away with the old guard!

410
00:29:56,043 --> 00:29:58,695
Now, a new era is upon us!

411
00:30:06,086 --> 00:30:07,738
For cryin' out loud...

412
00:30:08,347 --> 00:30:12,086
Hell of a time I picked
to become the Fleet Admiral...

413
00:30:12,696 --> 00:30:15,260
But no matter how they come at me,

414
00:30:15,260 --> 00:30:20,869
I'm gonna send hell right back at 'em!

415
00:30:51,826 --> 00:30:53,434
Hey, Beck...

416
00:30:56,043 --> 00:30:58,521
Think it's about time
we take it for ourselves...

417
00:31:05,217 --> 00:31:07,260
The One Piece!

418
00:31:32,913 --> 00:31:35,739
"Time's up'

419
00:31:37,086 --> 00:31:40,477
Someone said again, with a laugh

420
00:31:41,043 --> 00:31:45,477
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

421
00:31:46,217 --> 00:31:47,217
...is over

422
00:31:49,043 --> 00:31:52,347
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

423
00:31:52,565 --> 00:31:56,260
Let your heart beat out

424
00:31:57,260 --> 00:32:00,521
and things will change (We can see it soon)

425
00:32:00,739 --> 00:32:04,652
Grow strong, you have time

426
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:05,739
Lift up that dream

427
00:32:05,869 --> 00:32:12,739
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

428
00:32:12,869 --> 00:32:16,739
We were so free in our younger days

429
00:32:16,957 --> 00:32:20,043
What a dumb dream

430
00:32:20,260 --> 00:32:21,347
...to live

431
00:32:21,608 --> 00:32:25,347
Shining a light on uncharted ways

432
00:32:25,478 --> 00:32:29,478
Get on our feet and try

433
00:32:29,608 --> 00:32:33,347
Let's see the ends of the world together

434
00:32:33,478 --> 00:32:42,000
Together, we can go and fly